## Do not

- Convert skill/attachment uploads to WebP
- Port AI Multi-Modal generation
- Mix folder fichas into a document owner without an explicit copy (dotted assign always clones into the document asset)
- Reintroduce Video create unless product asks again
- Put assets/sets on the folder, or treat `#i` `#o` as heading/image blocks
- Store Attachments on the document — document icon must use the folder attachment corpus
- Show Attachments as a text tab on document (icon-only header control)
